=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the region lies below the $x$-axis, we have \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{3}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{A}_{3}=-2.\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-5}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={A}_{1}-{A}_{2}-{A}_{3} \\\\  & =8-2\\pi -2 \\\\  & =6-2\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289627 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289628 13194139534463 true] [17592186289627 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289629 13194139534463 true] [17592186289627 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289630 13194139534463 true] [17592186289627 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289631 13194139534463 true] [17592186289627 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289632 13194139534463 true] [17592186289627 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534463 true] [17592186289627 1041 "selection" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289627 1104 #edb/ref 17592186289630 13194139534463 true] [17592186289627 1110 #uuid "df8aa656-260b-58f4-a39c-8617ee5002a8" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289628 1034 "12\\pi " 13194139534463 true] [17592186289628 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [17592186289628 1111 #uuid "8ab64d5e-cd64-53d0-a3cb-2c1ec5159f33" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289629 1034 "4\\pi " 13194139534463 true] [17592186289629 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [17592186289629 1111 #uuid "1552a599-9efc-5d5a-8c48-092e46377238" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289630 1034 "6-2\\pi " 13194139534463 true] [17592186289630 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [17592186289630 1111 #uuid "3496e2fb-d5c9-56f1-96e9-aa339c0faf2b" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289631 1034 "3-\\pi " 13194139534463 true] [17592186289631 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [17592186289631 1111 #uuid "da7d4477-972e-53e3-a43e-d86035ceb85a" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289632 1034 "3-2\\pi " 13194139534463 true] [17592186289632 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [17592186289632 1111 #uuid "e8259267-b52c-58a7-bf17-76ea41a6551c" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289633 1017 #edb/ref 17592186289634 131941