responding region is a right triangle, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{3} & =\\frac{1}{2}bh \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the region lies below the $x$-axis, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{4}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{A}_{3}=-1.\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-4}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={A}_{1}+{A}_{2}-{A}_{3} \\\\  & =8+4-1 \\\\  & =11.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289669 13194139534463 true] [17592186289668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289670 13194139534463 true] [17592186289668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289671 13194139534463 true] [17592186289668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289672 13194139534463 true] [17592186289668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289673 13194139534463 true] [17592186289668 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534463 true] [17592186289668 1041 "selection" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289668 1104 #edb/ref 17592186289671 13194139534463 true] [17592186289668 1110 #uuid "42712ed9-5a3c-5ef9-80d4-fbb4396ae6ba" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289669 1034 "13" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289669 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [17592186289669 1111 #uuid "c87eeb99-3e4f-5c43-a2a9-9444183f192b" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289670 1034 "9" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289670 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [17592186289670 1111 #uuid "0f693360-1d6e-522c-bf4d-389e29b65467" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289671 1034 "11" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289671 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [17592186289671 1111 #uuid "b7336e5b-19d7-54c3-9d8b-d527be2ebcef" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289672 1034 "8" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289672 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [17592186289672 1111 #uuid "c93a060d-f9ad-5cad-802e-a562e8258701" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289673 1034 "5" 13194139534463 true] [17592186289673 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534463 true] [175921